---
description: >-
  architecture.iconSize and architecture.padding set in front matter: service icons, junction
  boxes and group padding follow them, a long service label wraps at iconSize x 1.5, and group
  titles carry their icon (padding x 0.75) beside the label.
config:
  architecture:
    iconSize: 120
    padding: 20
---
architecture-beta
    group outer(cloud)[Outer group with a long title]
    group inner(server)[Inner] in outer
    group bare in outer

    service web(internet)[A service label long enough to wrap] in inner
    service api(server)[API] in inner
    junction hub in bare
    service db(database)[DB]

    web:R --> L:api
    api:B -- T:hub
    hub:R -[stores]- L:db
    align row web api
